{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On running your own Shooting Range Shop Adventure you will</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host customers every day and try to fulfill their orders; expand and upgrade your shop to even host more customers. You can buy better guns and ammo as your level goes up; customers will always want more! Buy cases and sell what you got from them. Join shooting races and win prizes. You need to manage your resources to grow every day and remain in these hard business environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566070/extras/RentGun.gif?t=1742246817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rent various guns and sell ammo packs that fit the gun. You can unlock new guns and ammo types as you level up. Fill your shop with pistols, SMGs, and rifles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566070/extras/OpeningCase.gif?t=1742246817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566070/extras/PlaceSkin.gif?t=1742246817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open various cases to hunt rare gun skins. You can sell the skins you got in your shop to open more. As you level up you can open different types of cases, explore new skins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566070?t=1742246817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566070/daddef929b62b316f3732045d6b5b2e08623086a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742246817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566070/44b062627e446bce156c19c5bb2a369a7f9d80d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742246817"